      ":question/id": "24f7d07c-96a6-55b0-84fd-b9ad83013cc4",
      ":question/problem": "Find $k$ given that the vectors $a=\u27e88,-5,8\u27e9$, $b=\u27e8-2,4,3\u27e9$, and $c=\u27e88,k,-4\u27e9$ are coplanar.",
