      ":question/id": "d8f1d614-5a3f-5a0c-af91-d2d2841b779c",
      ":question/problem": "Find $k$ given that the vectors $a=\u27e8k^{2},1,7\u27e9$, $b=\u27e8-2,7,8\u27e9$, and $c=\u27e8-3,8,8\u27e9$ are coplanar.\n\n**In ascending order:**\n\n$k=${{field-1}}\nand\n$k=${{field-2}}",
