    "question": {
      ":question/id": "0fb15892-7874-576c-8c36-c4e16d9bc04d",
      ":question/problem": "Find $k$ given that the vectors $a=\u27e8-8,1,5\u27e9$, $b=\u27e8k,8,3\u27e9$, and $c=\u27e8-4,-2,0\u27e9$ are coplanar.",
