      ":question/problem": "Find $k$ given that the vectors $a=\u27e80,1,-2\u27e9$, $b=\u27e8k,-6,0\u27e9$, and $c=\u27e82,0,3\u27e9$ are coplanar.\n\n$k=${{field-1}}",
      ":question/answer-fields": [
        {
          ":answer-field/id": "ba085998-6f27-5f6f-be9f-64de68e1b62e",
