      ":question/problem": "Find $k$ given that the vectors $a=\u27e8-8,-2,k\u27e9$, $b=\u27e8-7,4,4\u27e9$, and $c=\u27e8-4,-6,6\u27e9$ are coplanar.\n\n$k=${{field-1}}",
      ":question/answer-fields": [
