    "question": {
      ":question/id": "7cfb9065-d405-52a7-a86d-ec7aaec76a37",
      ":question/problem": "Find $k$ given that the vectors $a=\u27e84,k^{2},-2\u27e9$, $b=\u27e8-1,4,-8\u27e9$, and $c=\u27e80,3,-3\u27e9$ are coplanar.\n\n**In ascending order:**\n\n$k=${{field-1}}\nand\n$k=${{field-2}}",
